  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>All things are connected, even when they seem separate.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Veilweaver level 11th, improved skin shift class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You gain the ability to use your skin shift as swarm skin. This special skin shift has an essence investment requirement of 3. When taking swarm forms, you treat your veilweaver level as your caster level when determining the effects of the spell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
